  _periodsDescriptions:
  - period: 0
    description: After a time paradox, this hat is now used by <b>prehistoric</b>
      people to play with their sabertooth cat.
  - period: 1
    description: After a time paradox, this funny hat is now usually worn during
      <b>Antiquity</b>, by politician when they speak in public.
  - period: 2
    description: After a time paradox, this funny hat is now commonly worn by <b>knights</b>
      on the battlefield.
  - period: 3
    description: This funny hat was traditionally worn by jesters during their performances
      before <b>nobles</b>.
